at the span wraps the `produce_code_review_verdict` delegation.","cohort":["G1G2"],"criteria":["G1G2"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.7,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["gate_dispatch.py:372-380 produce_code_review_verdict only calls _code_review_preflight/_assemble_code_review_run/_run_code_review_gate","gate_dispatch.py:523 the enclosing `with (gate_source.gate_read_root(handle), ... collect_step_failures())` around `_ex.run_workflow` sits in _run_code_review_gate, not produce_code_review_verdict","Plan text: 'open the run span ENCLOSING all three boundaries (... :372 code-review)'"],"finding":"The code-review boundary is cited as :372 (produce_code_review_verdict), but that function is a short orchestrator that delegates to _assemble_code_review_run and _run_code_review_gate; the run-enclosing `with` block that a run span must wrap around actually lives in _run_code_review_gate at :523.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f8cb08da5ea25fd9b","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach 'Three boundaries, not two.' and Scope ':372 code-review'","norm_id":"n07ae9566857c2643","priority":0.0,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Implementer opens the run span at :372 around the delegating call and gets correct enclosure, or misreads and opens it too narrowly"],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"Update the Scope/Approach to note the code-review run span must enclose the `with` block in `_run_code_review_gate` (gate_dispatch.py:523), reached via produce_code_review_verdict (:372).","tier":"LLM","validity":0.4286,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"na","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes",